    "Kies de molen waar je maalt. Je ziet dan de wind, de windrichting en de stoten op precies die plek.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose the windmill where you mill. You’ll see the wind, its direction and the gusts at exactly that spot."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähle die Mühle, an der du mahlst. Dann siehst du Wind, Windrichtung und Böen genau an diesem Ort."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
